{"type":"message","id":"ecf8378e","parentId":"e8c61422","timestamp":"2026-03-12T03:55:04.303Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求我走一遍完整的复盘流程生成内容。我需要：\n\n1. 先获取今天的行情数据（大盘指数、板块涨跌、资金流向等）\n2. 生成 Markdown 格式的复盘报告\n3. 从报告中提炼话题，生成小红书帖子内容\n\n由于 Tushare 和 portfolio-mcp 都没有配置，我需要用其他方式获取数据。让我尝试用 web_fetch 从东方财富获取行情数据。\n\n让我开始执行流程。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好！我现在走一遍完整流程，生成今天的复盘报告和小红书帖子内容。\n\n## 🚀 第一步：获取行情数据\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c1bc7b632c1e46d990d8d053","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://quote.eastmoney.com/center/hszs.html","extractMode":"text","maxChars":5000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0e661d21a6334253bca696bd","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://data.eastmoney.com/bkzj/","extractMode":"text","maxChars":8000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":38264,"output":351,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38615,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773287685559}}
