           - /url: javascript:;\n                  - generic [ref=e236]: \n                - link \"\" [ref=e237] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e238]: \n                - link \"\" [ref=e239] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e240]: \n                - link \"\" [ref=e241] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e242]: \n                - link [ref=e244] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - img [ref=e245]\n                - link \" 长文\" [ref=e247] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://mp.xueqiu.com/write/?position=pc_home_post\n                  - generic [ref=e248]: \n                  - text: 长文\n              - link \"发布\" [ref=e250]:\n                - /url: \"\"\n        - generic [ref=e251]:\n          - generic [ref=e253]:\n            - link \"关注\" [ref=e254] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"热门\" [ref=e255] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"7x24\" [ref=e256] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"自选\" [ref=e257] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"视频\" [ref=e258] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"基金\" [ref=e259] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"资讯\" [ref=e260] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"达人\" [ref=e261] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"私募\" [ref=e262] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"ETF\" [ref=e263] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n          - generic [ref=e264]:\n            - article [ref=e265]:\n              - link [ref=e266] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /3058599833\n                - img [ref=e267]\n              - generic [ref=e268]:\n                - generic [ref=e270]:\n                  - link \"买股票的老木匠\" [ref=e271] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /3058599833\n                  - link \"3小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e272] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /3058599833/379061114\n                - generic [ref=e275]:\n                  - text: 从2008年开始，美股的每一次调整，最终都涨回来了，并且很快就创出了新高，这其实给人一种强烈的暗示，就是美股的调整都不可怕，因为美国不会允许股价长期下跌。当然，原因都被说过多次了，无非就是美国家庭财产配置，养老金都在股市，还有就是选票等等。然而，并没有谁规定美股不能跌，美国法律和...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e276] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e277]:\n                  - link \" 6\" [ref=e278] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e279]: \n                    - generic [ref=e280]: \"6\"\n                  - link \" 171\" [ref=e281] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e282]: \n                    - generic [ref=e283]: \"171\"\n                  - link \" 410\" [ref=e284] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e285]: \n                    - generic [ref=e286]: \"410\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e287] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e288]: \n                    - generic [ref=e289]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e290]:\n              - link [ref=e291] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /cozone\n                - img [ref=e292]\n              - generic [ref=e293]:\n                - generic [ref=e295]:\n                  - link \"柯中\" [ref=e296] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /cozone\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e297]\n                  - link \"2小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e298] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5243796549/379082944\n                - generic [ref=e301]:\n                  - generic [ref=e302]:\n                    - text: 瑞银昨天开了个简短的电话会议，再次全面上调碳酸锂价格中枢到25万元每吨。\n                    - text: 核心逻辑就是我们周末发的那个文章类似的预期差：这一轮市场可能超市场预期\n                    - text: 供应端这块：\n                    - text: 1、今年供应大概在197.5万吨，明年到241.7万吨（同比22%）\n                    - text: 2、市场预测都是偏乐观，没有考虑爬坡，jxw复产延迟，...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e303] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e304]:\n                  - link \" 5\" [ref=e305] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e306]: \n                    - generic [ref=e307]: \"5\"\n                  - link \" 164\" [ref=e308] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e309]: \n                    - generic [ref=e310]: \"164\"\n                  - link \" 251\" [ref=e311] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e312]: \n                    - generic [ref=e313]: \"251\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e314] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e315]: \n                    - generic [ref=e316]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e317]:\n              - link [ref=e318] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /xiaofeng1983\n                - img [ref=e319]\n              - generic [ref=e320]:\n                - generic [ref=e322]:\n                  - link \"张小丰\" [ref=e323] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /xiaofeng1983\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e324]\n                  - img \"达人认证\" [ref=e325]\n                  - link \"3小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e326] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /9518372158/379058709\n                - generic [ref=e327]:\n                  - generic [ref=e329]:\n                    - generic [ref=e330]:\n                      - text: 回复\n                      - link \"@你敢下重注吗\" [ref=e331] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://xueqiu.com/n/你敢下重注吗\n                      - text: \": 我只是说智驾水平达到了另一个层级。简单来讲但凡真正体验过各个品牌城区智驾的人都会达成一共识：目前小鹏领先幅度实在是太大，不是强一点，是达到了另一个层级。\"\n                      - text: 而且我预计因为选择了正确的技术路线，小鹏未来1年智驾进步速度还会非常惊人，其他企业如果不改底层技术推...\n                    - link \"展开\" [ref=e332] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: \"\"\n                  - blockquote [ref=e333] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - link \"@张小丰 荣誉认证 达人认证 ：\" [ref=e335]:\n                      - /url: /xiaofeng1983\n                      - generic [ref=e336]: \"@张小丰\"\n                      - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e337]\n                      - img \"达人认证\" [ref=e338]\n                      - generic [ref=e339]: ：\n                    - generic [ref=e342]:\n                      - text: 试驾了小鹏的vla2.0智驾。一句话：真正的遥遥领先，就是懂交规的FSD。秒杀其他一切国产智驾。。。\n                      - text: 注1：其他智驾我都试过。\n                      - text: 注2：不持有小鹏股票，和投资无关。只是给大家提供一些信息。感兴趣的可以自己去试试。\n                    - generic [ref=e343]:\n                      - text: 昨天 14:29 · 转发 7\n                      - link \"· 讨论 370\" [ref=e344]:\n                        - /url: /9518372158/378962154#comment\n                      - text: · 赞 155\n                - generic [ref=e345]:\n                  - link \" 2\" [ref=e346] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e347]: \n                    - generic [ref=e348]: \"2\"\n                  - link \" 100\" [ref=e349] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e350]: \n                    - generic [ref=e351]: \"100\"\n                  - link \" 107\" [ref=e352] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e353]: \n                    - generic [ref=e354]: \"107\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e355] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e356]: \n                    - generic [ref=e357]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e358]:\n              - link [ref=e359] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /1329605961\n                - img [ref=e360]\n              - generic [ref=e361]:\n                - generic [ref=e363]:\n                  - link \"股价搬运工\" [ref=e364] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /1329605961\n                  - link \"修改于昨天 23:23· 来自雪球\" [ref=e365] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /1329605961/379034321\n                - generic [ref=e368]:\n                  - generic [ref=e369]:\n                    - text: 几点想法：\n                    - text: 1.既然量化会在活跃分支上反复提供流动性（近似周期内的品种有涨幅平权的特征），且市场长期存在局部主升，而情绪只会影响体感并不会影响阶段内主升载体的涨幅。所以，做主升载体的低吸是日常交易重点，这里的交易应该是该方向的持续性主观判断+核心标的筛选+逆情绪主动交易上（以...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e370] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e371]:\n                  - link \" 14\" [ref=e372] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e373]: \n                    - generic [ref=e374]: \"14\"\n                  - link \" 38\" [ref=e375] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e376]: \n                    - generic [ref=e377]: \"38\"\n                  - link \" 246\" [ref=e378] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e379]: \n                    - generic [ref=e380]: \"246\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e381] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e382]: \n                    - generic [ref=e383]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e384]:\n              - link [ref=e385] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /8600891662\n                - img [ref=e386]\n              - generic [ref=e387]:\n                - generic [ref=e389]:\n                  - link \"不可思亿\" [ref=e390] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /8600891662\n                  - link \"昨天 22:23· 来自iPhone\" [ref=e391] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /8600891662/379028794\n                - generic [ref=e392]:\n                  - generic [ref=e394]:\n                    - generic [ref=e395]:\n                      - text: 划重点：\n                      - text: 1、相较于上月，将lce目标价再次上调到25万。\n                      - text: 2、本轮为超长周期，储能需求有延续性，新能源车渗透率天花板还远未到来，未来几年需求增速持续大于供给增速\n                      - text: 和我们的区别目前只有第一个目标价了。\n                      - text: 瑞银的这份研报貌似没有几个人讨论的。\n                      - link \"$赣锋锂业(SZ002460)$\" [ref=e396] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/SZ002460\n                      - text: $中...\n                    - link \"展开\" [ref=e397] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: \"\"\n                  - blockquote [ref=e398] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - link \"@牡蛎奋斗 ：\" [ref=e400]:\n                      - /url: /5585730655\n                      - generic [ref=e401]: \"@牡蛎奋斗\"\n                      - generic [ref=e402]: ：\n                    - generic [ref=e404]:\n                      - generic [ref=e405]:\n                        - text: 瑞银3月10日发布：\n                        - text: 本轮锂价上行周期或长于市场预期（持续至2027年后），锂价有望涨至25万元/吨；供应端存在下行风险，需求端具备可持续性，供需错配将支撑锂价。\n                        - text: 基于与锂电行业专家电话会议，专家认为本轮锂价上行周期可能超出市场预期，锂价有望升至25万元/吨，并持续到2027年之后。\n                      - link \"展开\" [ref=e406]:\n                        - /url: \"\"\n                    - img [ref=e408]\n                    - generic [ref=e409]:\n                      - text: 昨天 16:55 · 转发 11\n                      - link \"· 讨论 144\" [ref=e410]:\n                        - /url: /5585730655/378989007#comment\n                      - text: · 赞 86\n                - generic [ref=e411]:\n                  - link \" 2\" [ref=e412] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e413]: \n                    - generic [ref=e414]: \"2\"\n                  - link \" 89\" [ref=e415] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e416]: \n                    - generic [ref=e417]: \"89\"\n                  - link \" 96\" [ref=e418] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e419]: \n                    - generic [ref=e420]: \"96\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e421] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e422]: \n                    - generic [ref=e423]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e424]:\n              - link [ref=e425] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /5421857763\n                - img [ref=e426]\n              - generic [ref=e427]:\n                - generic [ref=e429]:\n                  - link \"古董鱼\" [ref=e430] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5421857763\n                  - link \"昨天 23:57· 来自iPhone\" [ref=e431] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5421857763/379037485\n                - generic [ref=e434]:\n                  - generic [ref=e435]:\n                    - text: 最近光纤涨的太狠了，毫无疑问是今年AI硬件表现最好的，后面再能不能涨真的不知道了，股价目前肯定是反应了一大部分预期了。\n                    - text: 下面是我听交流专家给的价格数据，26年不到3个月价格走的太离谱了，当个参考，以后这种涨价的品种紧跟一些。\n                    - text: 652D 25年1月 17每公里每芯公里-25年12月 22元-12月...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e436] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e437]:\n                  - link \" 1\" [ref=e438] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e439]: \n                    - generic [ref=e440]: \"1\"\n                  - link \" 48\" [ref=e441] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e442]: \n                    - generic [ref=e443]: \"48\"\n                  - link \" 160\" [ref=e444] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e445]: \n                    - generic [ref=e446]: \"160\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e447] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e448]: \n                    - generic [ref=e449]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e450]:\n              - link [ref=e451] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /5992135535\n                - img [ref=e452]\n              - generic [ref=e453]:\n                - generic [ref=e455]:\n                  - link \"泽元投资\" [ref=e456] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5992135535\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e457]\n                  - img \"公司认证\" [ref=e458]\n                  - link \"4小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e459] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5992135535/379053079\n                - generic [ref=e460]:\n                  - generic [ref=e462]:\n                    - generic [ref=e463]:\n                      - text: 周期板块的行情正在雁行展开。\n                      - text: 据广发证券研究结果：PPI环比转正是周期板块走势的分水岭，通常在PPI转正之后，周期的超额收益迅速扩大。\n                      - text: 过往平均来看，周期板块启动的顺序（超额收益扩大的时点）：有色（PPI环比转前40个交易日，超额收益开始上行，T-40日）->化工（T-18日）->石油...\n                    - link \"展开\" [ref=e464] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: \"\"\n                  - img [ref=e466]\n                - generic [ref=e467]:\n                  - link \" 6\" [ref=e468] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e469]: \n                    - generic [ref=e470]: \"6\"\n                  - link \" 48\" [ref=e471] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e472]: \n                    - generic [ref=e473]: \"48\"\n                  - link \" 107\" [ref=e474] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e475]: \n                    - generic [ref=e476]: \"107\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e477] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n    